<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Control Devices cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Control Devices cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter confirmed it downgraded Control Devices Inc to neutral from buy after the company's shares hit the firm's price target.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 7/8 to 14-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
